---

<Base
  title="La Bienvenida — Sebastián Ortiz de Zevallos"
  description="Club house and condo design with natural low-cost materials."
  currentPage="projects"
  colorIndex={7}
  layout="split"
>
  <article class="project">
    <div class="project__year">2021 · Architecture</div>
    <h1 class="project__title">La Bienvenida</h1>
    <p class="project__subtitle">Personal work — club house &amp; condo</p>

    <div class="project__body">
      <p>
        As part of a country/beach condo I was commissioned to design the base
        plans for a club house, as well as images of the condo, base plans for
        example houses and renders that would interest buyers in purchasing a
        plot. The overall spirit of the project was to create a leisure space
        with natural low-cost materials, such as wood, adobe and brick.
      </p>

      <p>
        I decided to include this project in my portfolio since it shows my
        experience dealing with clients and meeting their needs. For them, the
        design was not the most important issue; they needed simple structures,
        drawings and renders to get customers.
      </p>

    </div>
  </article>

  <Gallery slot="gallery" slug="la-bienvenida" images={["01.png"]} alt="La Bienvenida" />
</Base>
